# Robot 1's feeder wheel with alwaysOn = true: it runs all the time the flywheel is on, so a POLLEN is always
# at the feeder arm, and the arm pushes at once (no stageSec). r1-feed-wheel.sim checks "only while firing".
# Run it: the "Simulator tests" button in Android Studio (all tests), or from the ftc-helper-lib folder:
#   ./gradlew :sim:scenario -Pfile=../simulator/scenarios/r1-feed-wheel-always.sim
robot ../robot.properties
set tunable FeederWheel.alwaysOn true
init "R1 TeleOp"
start
expect within 4 motor launcher velocity > 1000   # spins from START
press g1.right_bumper                  # RB: fire one
expect within 2 launched = 1
press g1.right_bumper                  # and a second one
expect within 2 launched = 2
stop
expect error none
